OL,3,GNEWSAHidden burial ground unearthed
OL,4,Aduring M5 dig
OL,5,
OL,6,FJulian Tooke of Gloucestershire County
OL,7,FCouncil said he was "really fired up"
OL,8,Fas the finds suggested people of three
OL,9,Fdifferent religions lived in the area
OL,10,F2,000 years ago.
